{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@2675","endTime":332297.287,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 14\nBR-tennis.\n\nA tennis and pickleball coaching website with course discovery, contact information, and account navigation.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nSports & coaching\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nLet the game introduce the coaching.\n\nBR-Tennis’ supplied website leads with tennis and pickleball coaching. Court photography introduces the offering, with navigation for courses, frequently asked questions, contact, and account access. The project-specific desktop designs show how the coaching proposition extends beyond the opening screen.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in BR-tennis's original project material.\n\n01\nCoaching introduction\n\nThe hero identifies tennis and pickleball as the primary subjects.\n\n02\nCourse discovery\n\nCourse navigation provides a route to the learning offering.\n\n03\nQuestions and contact\n\nPublic information areas support prospective participants.\n\n04\nAccount access\n\nSign-in and sign-up entry points appear in the supplied header.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nSports & coaching\n\nA dark navy header, yellow-green accents, and full-width court imagery establish an athletic identity. A compact navigation bar leaves room for a large introductory message, while lighter content sections support detailed course information.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside BR-tennis.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nBR-tennis's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nBR-tennis / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nNetwork Capital\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nMORTGAGE & FINANCE\nNetwork Capital\nCOURSES & LEARNING\nWhizara\nLEARNING OPERATIONS\nEs-Platform\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
